1
00:00:00,237 --> 00:00:01,667
(Sheldon:)I hate this planet.

2
00:00:07,711 --> 00:00:09,371
It says right here on the hammer:

3
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:13,680
"Whoever holds this hammer, if he be
worthy, shall possess the power of Thor."

4
00:00:13,884 --> 00:00:16,684
(Bernadette:)Hold on. Who decides who's worthy?
Does the hammer decide?

5
00:00:16,887 --> 00:00:18,517
- Yes!
- No!

6
00:00:20,724 --> 00:00:24,054
(Amy:)- It can't decide, it's a hammer.
- You said it's a magic hammer!

7
00:00:24,261 --> 00:00:26,021
(Amy:)Yeah, but it can't make decisions.

8
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:29,290
(Penny:)If Harry Potter's wand can make decisions,
why can't Thor's hammer?

9
00:00:29,533 --> 00:00:34,873
Okay, if you're gonna start comparing wands
and hammers, I can't even take you seriously.

10
00:00:52,823 --> 00:00:54,383
(Amy:)Hello.

11
00:00:55,759 --> 00:00:59,019
(Amy:)Hello.

